@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Login — Ana Teste (conta seed) — guarda o token para os próximos passos
# @name loginAna
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "111.111.111-11",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login — Bruno Teste (para testar 403 com conta alheia)
# @name loginBruno
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "222.222.222-22",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Criar conta (Idempotency-Key opcional)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: create-account-1

{
  "name": "Novo User",
  "cpf": "444.444.444-44",
  "accountType": 0,
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Saldo (Ana — seed 105000 centavos / R$ 1050,00)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### Crédito de R$ 50,00 (5000 centavos) vindo do Bruno (Idempotency-Key obrigatória;
### CounterpartyCpf opcional — ausente vira "AUTO-DEPOSITO {NNN-NN} CC")
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: movement-1

{
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 5000,
  "counterpartyCpf": "222.222.222-22"
}

### Replay da mesma chave — deve repetir a resposta, sem duplicar
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: movement-1

{
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 5000,
  "counterpartyCpf": "222.222.222-22"
}

### Crédito em espécie (R$ 25,00 / 2500 centavos) na boca do caixa — sem CounterpartyCpf
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: movement-cash

{
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 2500
}

### Débito acima do saldo — deve falhar com 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: movement-2

{
  "type": 1,
  "amount": 999999
}

### Histórico paginado
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/movements?page=1&pageSize=3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### Upload de avatar (multipart) — requer um arquivo avatar.png ao lado deste .http
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----dindin-boundary

------dindin-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< avatar.png
------dindin-boundary--

### Download do avatar (stream)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.token}}

### Sem token — deve falhar com 401
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/balance

### Token de outra conta (Bruno na conta da Ana) — deve falhar com 403
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBruno.response.body.token}}
